# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the image installs. Above all
# this keeps a repo-root .env (bot tokens) and any discord-client.toml or
# pulled transcripts out of the context sent to the Docker daemon, not just
# out of the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!discord_client/
discord_client/**/__pycache__
